- **Never** attach character meshes to hull `Attach_*` sockets.

### 3D vs 2D

| Layer | Content |
|-------|---------|
| 3D `AFleet` | Hull + `MastRig` packages (Furled/Half/Full), flag, figurehead, rudder, anchor, damage FX, optional weapons |
