### First workflow ship (SmallSailer01)

~15m single-mast small trader (concept only — **no** program hard-check on 15m / tonnage). Strategic view priority: **mast count > deck levels > rig silhouette > hull outline > major parts > small decor**. Typical camera **50–200m**; no Crew Socket.

