|-------|----------|
| **3D** | Hull + per-ship-type modules (see below) |
| **2D** | `T_<ShipType>_OutfitDiagram` — same type identity as 3D |

Cargo holds: 3D may show empty hold structure only — **no** dynamic cargo meshes. Rigging: **visual only**; simplified; **not** shared with future boarding ropes.

