## Bootstrap

- **Player:** no preset fleet or ship. Hometown (temp **London**). Harbor **领取** one temp-type ship (player-owned, numbered name) → compose fleet.
- **NPC:** each seeded company still gets one fleet + at least one company ship as flagship; commander = owner; at HQ harbor as `AFleet`. Hull from company seed `StarterShipTypeId` (built-in: Advisor = Caravel, Quartermaster = Carrack). Not in `PlayerCommandedFleetId`.

## Explicitly out (this slice)

- Shipyard build rules, ship commodity trade, 改造, 改装 stats (sails / cannons), officer stat mods, Facility ship compartments, harbor ungrouped cap, random fleet-name pool, at-sea flagship UI, abandon / capture, multi-fleet command switch, per-ship combat HP
